{"seq":3,"slug":"immutability-values","title":"不可变与持久数据结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/clojure-lisp/foundations/immutability-values","wordCount":1239,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"不可变与持久数据结构\">不可变与持久数据结构</h1><p>给一个有一百万条目的 Clojure 映射「添加」一个键，会发生什么？直觉说：要么复制整个映射（昂贵到不可接受），要么偷偷改掉原映射（破坏不可变）。Clojure 的答案是第三种：返回一个新映射，与旧映射共享几乎全部内部结构，新增成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——对一百万条目而言，不到五步。这种「看起来全量复制、实际上结构共享」的魔法，是 Clojure 让不可变变得实用的核心工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「持久数据结构」（persistent data structure）这个名字容易误解——它不是指存到磁盘，而是指修改后旧版本依然完整可用。每次「修改」产生一个新版本，所有历史版本永久有效且互不干扰。实现这一点的关键是不复制全部、只复制被改路径上的节点，其余共享。下图以一棵树的更新为例展示结构共享。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 新版本&#10;    R2[&quot;根&#39;&quot;] --&gt; N1[&quot;节点 A&lt;br/&gt;(共享)&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; N2b[&quot;节点 B&#39;&lt;br/&gt;(新建)&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 旧版本&#10;    R1[&quot;根&quot;] --&gt; N1&#10;    R1 --&gt; N2[&quot;节点 B&lt;br/&gt;(保留)&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  N2b -.指向未改子树.-&gt; N1\">graph TD\n  subgraph 新版本\n    R2[\"根'\"] --&gt; N1[\"节点 A&lt;br/&gt;(共享)\"]\n    R2 --&gt; N2b[\"节点 B'&lt;br/&gt;(新建)\"]\n  end\n  subgraph 旧版本\n    R1[\"根\"] --&gt; N1\n    R1 --&gt; N2[\"节点 B&lt;br/&gt;(保留)\"]\n  end\n  N2b -.指向未改子树.-&gt; N1</pre><p>旧根和新根各自指向自己的根节点，但「节点 A」这棵未被触及的子树被两个版本共享。只有从根到被改元素路径上的节点被重建。于是更新的代价正比于树的高度而非元素总数，旧版本毫发无损。这一不可变性质正是 Rich Hickey 的核心赌注之一，背景见 <a href=\"lisp-heritage\">Lisp 传承与 Clojure 定位</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hamt-32-路分支的秘密\">HAMT：32 路分支的秘密</h2><p>Clojure 的向量和映射底层都是一种叫 HAMT（Hash Array Mapped Trie）的变体——本质是一棵每个节点最多有 32 个子节点的浅而宽的树。选 32 不是随意的：它让树的高度被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_{32} n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 压得极低。即便十亿元素，树高也不过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil \\log_{32} 10^9 \\rceil = 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 层。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>链表</th>\n<th>可变数组</th>\n<th>Clojure 向量(HAMT)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按索引读</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 近似常数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末尾追加</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>头部</td>\n<td>摊还 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>摊还 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「修改」一个元素</td>\n<td>复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>破坏性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不破坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旧版本是否保留</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在实践中表现得像常数：因为底数是 32，对任何现实规模的数据，树高都在个位数。Clojure 用这点性能上的微小让步，换来了完整的不可变语义和历史版本保留——这笔交易在并发场景里回报极高，见 <a href=\"../ecosystem/concurrency-stm\">并发与 STM</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"值语义-相等基于内容而非身份\">值语义：相等基于内容而非身份</h2><p>不可变带来一个深远后果：两个值是否相等，只看内容，不看它们是不是同一个对象。在 Java 里 <code>new ArrayList().equals(...)</code> 要小心 <code>equals</code> 与 <code>==</code> 的区别；在 Clojure 里，<code>(= [1 2 3] [1 2 3])</code> 永远为真，因为向量是值，而值「就是它的内容」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"clojure\" data-code=\"(def a {:x 1 :y 2})&#10;(def b (assoc a :z 3))   ; b 是新映射, a 不变&#10;(= a {:x 1 :y 2})        ; =&gt; true, 比的是内容&#10;(:z a)                   ; =&gt; nil, a 从未被改动&#10;(:z b)                   ; =&gt; 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(def a {:x 1 :y 2})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(def b (assoc a :z 3))   ; b 是新映射, a 不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(= a {:x 1 :y 2})        ; => true, 比的是内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(:z a)                   ; => nil, a 从未被改动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(:z b)                   ; => 3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>值语义让程序大幅减少防御性复制。在可变世界里，把一个集合传给函数，你得担心它会不会被偷偷改掉，于是处处复制。在 Clojure 里这种焦虑消失了——你拿到的值没人能改，传递它就是免费的。这种「数据可以自由共享」的习惯，正是函数式编程无副作用风格的基础，见 <a href=\"../functional/higher-order\">高阶函数与转换器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瞬态-在局部偷偷可变\">瞬态：在局部偷偷可变</h2><p>不可变虽好，但当你要在一个紧凑循环里构建一个大集合，每一步都生成新版本会产生可观的中间垃圾。Clojure 给出一个不破坏整体契约的逃生舱——瞬态（transient）。</p>\n<p>瞬态是持久数据结构的一个「临时可变视图」：在一段局部代码里，你以接近可变结构的速度连续修改它，最后再 <code>persistent!</code> 一次性「封印」回不可变。关键约束是这块可变性绝不外泄——瞬态不能在线程间共享，封印后原瞬态作废。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"clojure\" data-code=\"(defn build-vec [n]&#10;  (persistent!&#10;    (reduce conj! (transient []) (range n))))  ; 局部可变, 整体不可变\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(defn build-vec [n]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (persistent!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (reduce conj! (transient []) (range n))))  ; 局部可变, 整体不可变</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 Clojure 务实气质的典型体现：默认安全的不可变，但在性能确实关键的局部，提供一个有严格边界的可变窗口。它和 <a href=\"../functional/recursion-loop\">递归与 loop/recur</a> 里的累积模式常常配合使用，共同构成高效构建大数据结构的惯用法。理解了瞬态的「局部可变、全局不可变」边界，也就理解了 Clojure 在纯粹与实用之间的一贯取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持久数据结构指修改后旧版本依然完整可用，靠结构共享而非全量复制实现。</li>\n<li>HAMT 用 32 路分支把树高压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_{32} n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，使「修改」代价近似常数且不破坏旧版本。</li>\n<li>值语义让相等基于内容，消除防御性复制，使数据可以自由共享与传递。</li>\n<li>瞬态提供有严格边界的局部可变窗口，在性能关键处避免中间垃圾，封印后回归不可变。</li>\n<li>不可变是 Rich Hickey 的核心赌注，它的并发红利在第四章兑现，它支撑的无副作用风格在第二章展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"不可变与持久数据结构","id":"不可变与持久数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HAMT：32 路分支的秘密","id":"hamt-32-路分支的秘密"},{"level":2,"text":"值语义：相等基于内容而非身份","id":"值语义-相等基于内容而非身份"},{"level":2,"text":"瞬态：在局部偷偷可变","id":"瞬态-在局部偷偷可变"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语法即数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/clojure-lisp/foundations/syntax-data"},"next":{"title":"序列与惰性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/clojure-lisp/functional/sequences-laziness"}}